        {
          "id": "single-source-grid",
          "description": "One shared rectangular lattice with 19 vertical lines and 13 horizontal lines: 18 columns by 12 rows, step 0.5 on both axes, zero phase; x runs -2.5..6.5, y runs -2..4. Grid line gaps around printed axis values and small scan breaks are typography/damage, not missing cells. Rectification of scanning skew is modern.",
